  unitName: Great Falcon Ziz
  unitId: 40093
  unitNumber: 118
  description: A mutant Thunderbird. With an even larger body than the Thunderbird,
    it's wing span is so big that its spread wings are said to block out the sun.
    Its lightning attacks are far stronger than the Thunderbird's, and those directly
    struck are electroshocked instantly. Summoners who confront the intimidating
    Ziz most focus on survival before all else.
  summonDesc: Do you want my lightning?<br>Take me to your enemies.<br>I will show
    them fear.
  fusionDesc: Lightning, shoot forth!<br>Lightning, spread!
  evoDesc: Can you feel it, Summoner?<br>The power of my lightning <br>is undeniable!
